@startuml admin search user
title Admin Search User — Sequence Diagram

actor Admin <<actor>>
boundary "AdminUserSearchPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control "AdminUserController" as Controller <<control>>
control "UserService" as Service <<control>>
control "UserRepository" as Repository <<control>>
entity "User" as UserModel <<entity>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<entity>>

Admin -> UI: Enter search criteria
UI -> Controller: GET /admin/users?query=...
Controller -> Service: searchUsers(query)
Service -> Repository: search(query, filters)
Repository -> DB: SELECT users
UserModel --> Repository: rows
Repository --> Service: userList
Service --> Controller: userList
Controller --> UI: render users

@enduml